==German==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|gmh|de}} {{term|swëben|lang=gmh}}, from {{etyl|goh|de}} {{term|swebēn|lang=goh}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|de}} {{term/t|gem-pro|*swibēną||to move}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|de}} {{term/t|ine-pro|*sweyp-}}, {{term/t|ine-pro|*sweyb-||to twist, turn around}}. Cognate with {{etyl|nl|-}} {{term|zweven||to float|lang=nl}}.

===Verb===
{{de-verb-weak|schwebt|schwebte|geschwebt|auxiliary=sein}}

# to [[hover]], to [[float]]

